---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Page Not Found" description="This page doesn't exist — but your organized home does. Find your way back to My Sorted Nest guides.">
<section class="py-space-xl text-center max-w-[640px] mx-auto">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">404</span>
<h1 class="font-display-hero text-display-hero-mobile lg:text-display-hero text-on-surface mt-space-sm mb-space-md">This corner isn't organized yet.</h1>
<p class="font-body-lead text-body-lead text-on-surface-variant mb-space-lg">The page you're looking for moved or never existed. Let's get you back to something useful.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-space-sm">
<a href="/" class="px-space-lg py-3 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-lg font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors">Back Home</a>
<a href="/blog/" class="px-space-lg py-3 bg-surface-container text-on-surface rounded-lg font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">Browse Guides</a>
<a href="/search/" class="px-space-lg py-3 bg-surface-container text-on-surface rounded-lg font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">Search</a>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
